### Kiro

Use the prompt files in `.kiro/prompts/` or natural-language instructions referencing the workflow phases:

| Phase | Prompt file | Natural-language instruction |
|---|---|---|
| Discover | `.kiro/prompts/discover-next.md` | *"Run the Discover workflow for [feature]"* |
| Plan | `.kiro/prompts/plan-next.md` | *"Plan [feature] based on DISC-###"* |
| Implement | `.kiro/prompts/implement-next.md` | *"Implement the next task in mvp-1.0"* |
| Troubleshoot | `.kiro/prompts/troubleshoot-next.md` | *"Troubleshoot [issue]"* |

Outputs always go to `openspec/changes/` — never to `.kiro/specs/`.

Kiro reads project context from `.kiro/steering/`:
- `00-project.md` — project identity and OpenSpec map
- `01-workflow.md` — Discover → Plan → Implement → Troubleshoot phases
- `02-architecture.md` — architecture constraints
- `03-tooling.md` — approved tech stack and dependencies
{{/if}}
